message: "Please cite this package and the original model sources listed in SOURCES.md."
title: "Fourteen observation bits for a fixed Boolean release protocol"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
authors:
  - family-names: Takimoto
    given-names: Tatsuhiko
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: "Certificate package for a frozen 56-rule Boolean benchmark. With a specified four-bit atomic clamp and fair single-bit updates, fourteen observation bits in addition to the five readouts are necessary and sufficient for the specified current-value equality guard on a fixed set S. Other guards, observation histories and interventions are not optimized. License entries cover project-owned contributions only; third-party model terms are described in LICENSE and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md."
keywords:
  - Boolean network
  - partial observation
  - model checking
  - release guard
  - certificate verification
